// Title: SCM Database Privileged Operation
// ID: dae8171c-5ec6-4396-b210-8466585b53e9
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: Roberto Rodriguez @Cyb3rWard0g, Tim Shelton
// Date: 2019-08-15
// Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.t1548
// Description: Detects non-system users performing privileged operation os the SCM database
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((EventID EQ "4674" AND ObjectType EQ "SC_MANAGER OBJECT" AND ObjectName EQ "servicesactive" AND PrivilegeList EQ "SeTakeOwnershipPrivilege") AND NOT ((SubjectLogonId EQ "0x3e4" AND ProcessName ENDSWITH ":\\Windows\\System32\\services.exe")))
